    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Players will play as bystanders searching for the truth, gradually uncovering the mysterious veil of the school bullying incident by collecting clues left in the ruins.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3417130/extras/6e859ca735c692cb74a77ad7d36a25cd.avif?t=1736214240\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Top tier exploration experience</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this process, players need to be wary of monsters bred by malicious intent, which hide in the shadows and wait for opportunities to move. And the player's task is to identify their true identity.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3417130/extras/110bd89c2ee174d0a44b73e83e6a90bb.avif?t=1736214240\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game is divided into three chapters, each centered around a major event that happened in the school that year, and players will encounter stories from these events. As the protagonist, how will you save those who are trapped in the vortex? All of this is up to you to decide.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is an adventure game with a story driven core, where players will constantly reflect on their own cognition throughout the game until they finally uncover the true insider information.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After playing 'Escape from School', you will no longer fear any difficulties!</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Players will play as bystanders searching for the truth, gradually uncovering the mysterious veil of the school bullying incident by collecting clues left in the ruins.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3417130/extras/6e859ca735c692cb74a77ad7d36a25cd.avif?t=1736214240\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Top tier exploration experience</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this process, players need to be wary of monsters bred by malicious intent, which hide in the shadows and wait for opportunities to move. And the player's task is to identify their true identity.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3417130/extras/110bd89c2ee174d0a44b73e83e6a90bb.avif?t=1736214240\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game is divided into three chapters, each centered around a major event that happened in the school that year, and players will encounter stories from these events. As the protagonist, how will you save those who are trapped in the vortex? All of this is up to you to decide.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is an adventure game with a story driven core, where players will constantly reflect on their own cognition throughout the game until they finally uncover the true insider information.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After playing 'Escape from School', you will no longer fear any difficulties!</p></li></ul>",
    "short_description": "&quot;GET OUT SCHOOL&quot; is a horror adventure game about campus bullying. The game character, on her way home, encounters a strange event that transports her to a different high school in another time and space. As a student there, what will she face? Discover in the game!",
